    "description": "Eric Queen's two-stage-to-orbit conceptual model. Inputs to this aero model are alpha and beta in degrees. Outputs are force and moment coefficients in Lift, Drag, Sideforce, and pitch and yaw moments. Rolling moment is zero. Moments are defined about the moment reference center, which is a function of vehicle configuration (staged or not). The position of the moment reference center is an output of the inertia properties model. A slight modification has been made to make drag coefficient a function of total alpha instead of just alpha.",
